                <p>The ADVAC® G40 vacuum generator circuit breaker is available at <span data-field="g40_voltage">{{ g40_voltage }}</span>, <span data-field="g40_current">{{ g40_current }}</span>, <span data-field="g40_kA">{{ g40_kA }}</span> in compliance with IEEE/IEC 62271-37. With the ADVAC® G40 offers a small footprint and full protection for power generation applications.</p>
                <p>Features:</p>
