<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <div style="flex-basis: 30%;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px;">SAFEGEAR® 5/15 kV, UP TO 50 kA ARC-RESISTANT SWITCHGEAR</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="flex-basis: 70%; text-align: right;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px;">DESCRIPTIVE BULLETIN</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div class="two-column-layout">
            <div class="column">
                <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">AMVAC™ breakers</h2>
                <p>General overview</p>
                <p>The AMVAC™ breaker is a magnetically actuated and latched breaker capable of a high number of operations due to its simplified design. Fully compliant with IEEE/IEC 62271-37, the AMVAC® breaker is a great fit for many applications.</p>
                <p>Features:</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Mechanical operations counter</li>
                    <li>Optional roll-on floor design</li>
                    <li>Safety enhanced, tested solution for DC-com-ponent</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Available AMVAC breaker ratings</p>
                <div class="table-container">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Voltage class</th>
                            <th>Nominal voltages</th>
                            <th>Continuous current</th>
                            <th>Short circuit current (kA)</th>
                            <th>BIL (kV)</th>
                            <th>Power frequency</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for row in amvac_ratings %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ row.voltage_class }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.nominal_voltages }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.continuous_current }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.short_circuit_current }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.bil }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.power_frequency }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="column">
                <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">Distribution protection and control</h2>
                <p>ABB's Relion® family of protection and control relays for distribution applications provides the highest level of protection and control for your electrical systems. The Relion® 615 and 620 series offer complete protection and control for distribution applications, providing the highest level of protection and control for your electrical systems.</p>
                <p>The IEC 61850 implementation in Relion® allows for seamless integration with modern substation automation systems, enabling advanced monitoring and control of your electrical assets.</p>
                <p>Relion® relays are fully IEC 61850 compliant for communication and interoperability of substation-related devices, ensuring a modern and future-proof electrical infrastructure.</p>
                <p>Relion relays for feeder protection offer an optional communication interface, allowing for advanced monitoring and control of the feeder. This feature helps users to gain deeper insights into the performance of the feeder, resulting in reduced downtime.</p>
                <p>ABB's ComboGrid Automation Controller can be used to monitor and control the switchgear lineup, providing a centralized view of the entire system. This allows for faster troubleshooting and easier maintenance of the switchgear lineup.</p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_1.png" alt="Diagram 1" style="width: 150px; margin: 10px;">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Diagram 2" style="width: 150px; margin: 10px;">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_3.png" alt="Diagram 3" style="width: 150px; margin: 10px;">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <div style="flex-basis: 30%;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px;">SAFEGEAR® 5/15 kV, UP TO 50 kA ARC-RESISTANT SWITCHGEAR</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="flex-basis: 70%; text-align: right;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px;">DESCRIPTIVE BULLETIN</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div class="two-column-layout">
            <div class="column">
                <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">Switchgear monitoring</h2>
                <p>SafeGear can be provided with integrated IR windows, from multiple manufacturers, on the rear door to facilitate thermal monitoring of the cable connections.</p>
                <p>For users wanting a greater peace of mind, SafeGear also comes with a 24x7 monitoring solution for temperature, humidity, and partial discharge activity.</p>
                <p>The temperature monitoring is done using either IR</p>
                <p>sensor technology or SAW sensor technology. The PD activity is monitored with UHF antennas and specialized signal processing.</p>
                <p>The monitored data is available locally, as well as remotely in the user's SCADA or historian systems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="column">
                <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">SafeGear® Digital An ABB Ability™ solution</h2>
                <p>SafeGear® Digital is an advanced medium voltage switchgear solution — reliability and simplicity are its hallmarks. Digitalization of the protection and control system simplifies construction while increasing safety and versatility. ABB is taking the next dramatic leap forward in advancing the technology of switchgear solutions.</p>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 16px;">Reduced footprint</h3>
                        <p>Sensors are more compact than traditional instrument transformers, allowing for a smaller enclosure.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Up to <span data-field="footprint_reduction_percent">{{ footprint_reduction_percent }}</span> reduction</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 16px;">Faster delivery to site</h3>
                        <p>More efficient engineering versus conventional construction.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Up to <span data-field="delivery_time_reduction_percent">{{ delivery_time_reduction_percent }}</span> faster</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 16px;">Optimized weight</h3>
                        <p>Conventional instrument transformers weigh more than digital sensors.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Up to <span data-field="weight_reduction_percent">{{ weight_reduction_percent }}</span> reduction</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 16px;">Faster installation/commissioning</h3>
                        <p>Fewer components to test and commission.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Up to <span data-field="installation_time_reduction_percent">{{ installation_time_reduction_percent }}</span> faster</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 16px;">Fewer components to test and commission</h3>
                        <p>Fewer components to test and commission.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Up to <span data-field="component_reduction_percent">{{ component_reduction_percent }}</span> reduction</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
